m/ringbuffer.cljc:27,185`; `memory_log.cljc:73`; `ws.cljc:122`;\\\\\\\\n422: `remote.cljc:1249`; `remote_pair.cljc:180`; `remote_route.cljc:173`;\\\\\\\\n423: `journal.cljc:296`; `dao/jing/content/step.cljc:132`; `dao/lease.cljc:594`;\\\\\\\\n424: `dao/await.cljc:235,240`; `dao/space/store/fs.cljc:137,351`;\\\\\\\\n425: `yin/vm/linker.cljc:1685`; `yin/vm/ucf/custody.cljc:46`;\\\\\\\\n426: `yin/vm/ucf/holder/driver.cljc:1507`; `yin/vm/ffi/remote_serve.cljc:417,604,606`;\\\\\\\\n427: `yin/vm/telemetry.cljc:112`; `yin/repl.cljc:667,668,733,918`;\\\\\\\\n428: `yin/repl/dht.cljc:117`. Other sources: `rand` at `rpc.cljc:114-116`,\\\\\\\\n429: `rand-int` at `jing/dht.cljc:373`; secure generators at\\\\\\\\n430: `space/dht.cljc:142-151` and `sign.cljc:119-123`; `gensym` at three sites;\\\\\\\\n431: clocks at `main.cljc:1242-1542` (driver) and `driver.clj:169,206` (JVM lane);\\\\\\\\n432: ambient at `fs.cljc:92,136,271-273`, `repl.cljc:275-277`, `main.cljc`;\\\\\\\\n433: printing at `main.cljc` (19) and `antlr/repl.cljc:71`; timers at\\\\\\\\n434: `async.cljc:52-57`, `storage.cljc:224-227`, `main.cljc:1321,1343`. All are\\\\\\\\n435: deferred-scope entries (§9) except the clocks and printing in `main.cljc`\\\\\\\\n436: (driver). None is in an H0-H4 file.\\\\\\\\n437: \\\\\\\\n438: ### 3.3 Exempt dialect syntax\\\\\\\\n439: \\\\\\\\n440: Not host contact; the H0 gate exempts them by pattern: `catch` type arms;\\\\\\\\n441: `^long`/`^bytes`/`^String` hints; protocol and interface names in `deftype`\\\\\\\\n442: bodies and `print-method`; `exists?`; `js-obj`/`(Object.)` opaque sentinels;\\\\\\\\n443: require arms whose only purpose is an alias.\\\\\\\\n444: \\\\\\\"}]},{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tool_result\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tool_use_id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"call_9b248d06fc734c758d06c85e\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Read 1/1 file, 188 lines\\\\\\\\nNote: showing lines 685-872. More of the file remains. Use o